<item>
            <title>[LU-20777] LNet: NI link down causes lnetctl import segfault  </title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20777</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If any of the NIs listed in the imported lnet conf file is in &quot;link down&quot; state, lnetctl crashes (segfaults).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
lustre_rmmod
modprobe lnet
lnetctl lnet configure
lnetctl &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; lnet.conf&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;lnetctl net add&quot; doesn&apos;t appear to have this problem.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
